  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan draws Immortal Gu from the sleeping immortal zombie Bo Qing. Flying sword Gu comes fourth: rank seven, shaped like a silver-winged dragonfly, and one of the Immortal Gu Bo Qing used most often in combat. He used that Gu as a core, together with other Immortal Gu and mortal Gu, and created many sword path killer moves. Pursuing flying sword is listed with formless flying sword, cloud flying sword, and ten thousand li flying sword as examples of those moves.",
